{"ref":"BDB, נָצָה²","hw":"נָצָה²","html":"† III. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נָצָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. fall in ruins</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרַיִךְ תִּצֶּינָה מֵאֵין יוֹשֵׁב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.7\">Je 4:7</a> <em>thy cities shall fall in ruins</em> (read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּנָּצֶינָה</span> <strong>Niph.</strong>).<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלִּים נִצִּים</span> <em>ruined heaps</em>, i.e. ruin-heaps, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.25\">2 K 19:25</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.26\">Is 37:26</a>.—On <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.15\">Je 2:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.9\">9:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.19\">46:19</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, יָצַת\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_יָצַת\">יצת</a>.","next":"BDB, נִצָּה","prev":"BDB, מַצּוּת²"}